     "body": "Running `go test ./internal/agent ./internal/gui -run '^(…)$' -count=1` on the Windows box (xiaomi-gpu, Go 1.26.8, win-run) at origin/main 8aae124b0, with no local change, 37 tests fail. With 4652653b0 (agent.Looks) on top, the same 37 fail; nothing new.\n\nWindows CI only compiles the tests, so nothing shows these. Some have issues of their own (#1827, #4115, #5324, #5130, #5605, #5950, #5068, #5928); this lists the set as it is today so each can be taken:\n\n- TestAionUiImportRow\n- TestAppliedOfParsesAnUnchangedFileOnce\n- TestAsideOfflineDisconnectRestoresWithoutDaemon\n- TestCherryStudioImportRow\n- TestClaudeDesktopCarriesTheLanguage\n- TestClaudeDesktopSealedKeyOpened\n- TestClaudeViaMagpieKept\n- TestCodexOwnModelsFollowPicks\n- TestCodexSignInInKeychain\n- TestCodexSyncMendsGoneCatalog\n- TestCopilotFolderFromAnIDEPluginIsNotTheCLI\n- TestDesktopExec\n- TestDesktopHandlerNeedsItsEntryAndProgram\n- TestDesktopOpensWhatDesktopSealed\n- TestGatewayHeldByAContainer\n- TestGatewayModeStatsNameTheGatewaySessions\n- TestGrokFoldsItsOwnAccount\n- TestHermesProfileModels\n- TestHermesProfilesFollowMagpieModel\n- TestHowInstalledWindowsShim\n- TestImportStatusUnreadableIsUnknown\n- TestInstallWithoutNodeParses\n- TestLodyImportHandoff\n- TestMagpieModelsKeptWhileCatalogStays\n- TestMiseShimWindowsFiveAgents\n- TestOpenLodyRunsItsDesktopEntry\n- TestOpenMausBotRestartOnMac\n- TestOwnModelsSayTheyGoDirect\n- TestOwnOptionsKept\n- TestPluginAgentMissingSaysSo\n- TestProviderSaveClientCert\n- TestQoderSettingsFromAnIDEPluginIsNotTheCLI\n- TestT3CodeCodexInstance\n- TestUpdateThatWontStart\n- TestViaMagpieKeptWhileCatalogStays\n- TestWithViaKeepsTheJoinedList\n- TestWorkBuddyOwnSaveAfterStartIsNoChange\n- TestWorkBuddyRestartOnMac\n",
